# No API keys are required for the market data planes.
# Yahoo Finance chart API -> price, daily history, intraday volume
# Stooq -> daily historical fallback
# FINRA public API -> short interest + Reg SHO short-sale volume
# TradingView public scanner -> market cap + free float

# Optional SEC descriptive User-Agent if you later enable the FTD downloader:
# SEC_USER_AGENT=Squeeze-Race/1.0 contact@example.com
